  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att s&#xe4;kra att barnens r&#xe4;ttigheter respekteras i det r&#xe4;ttsliga systemet. St&#xf6;det g&#xe5;r till tre pilotprojekt samt koordinering genom ett sekretariat. Tekniskt st&#xf6;d genom svensk r&#xe5;dgivare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to ensure that children&apos;s rights are respected at every stage of Juvenile Justice Admonistration. Support to three pilots and co-ordination via a Secretariat. Techical assistance in the form of a Swedish Project Advisor.</narrative>
